# STAC code owners
#
# The LAST matching pattern wins. Code owners are requested automatically as
# reviewers, and the ruleset governance/rulesets/main-protection.json requires
# an approving review from a code owner of every changed path before merge.
#
# GitHub only honours teams that have at least WRITE access to this repository.
# Members of a team with Triage access can review, but their approval does not
# count. See governance/roles-matrix.md for the team set-up.
#
# Moderators are co-owners of every section so that a section never gets
# stuck when its curators are unavailable.

# Fallback: everything not matched below
*                                                       @stac-archive/moderators

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ content
/instruments/art-and-aesthetics/                        @stac-archive/aesthetics-curators @stac-archive/moderators
/instruments/creativity/                                @stac-archive/creativity-curators @stac-archive/moderators
/instruments/personality-and-individual-differences/    @stac-archive/personality-curators @stac-archive/moderators

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ infrastructure
/scripts/                                               @stac-archive/infra
/site/                                                  @stac-archive/infra
/worker/                                                @stac-archive/infra
/config/                                                @stac-archive/infra
/.github/                                               @stac-archive/infra

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ rules of the archive
# Changes to what counts as a valid entry, who may decide, and who owns what
# always need a moderator.
/schema/                                                @stac-archive/moderators
/governance/                                            @stac-archive/moderators
/templates/                                             @stac-archive/moderators
/.github/CODEOWNERS                                     @stac-archive/moderators
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/                                @stac-archive/moderators @stac-archive/infra
/.github/DISCUSSION_TEMPLATE/                           @stac-archive/moderators @stac-archive/infra
/GOVERNANCE.md                                          @stac-archive/moderators
/CONTRIBUTING.md                                        @stac-archive/moderators
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md                                     @stac-archive/moderators
/PRIVACY.md                                             @stac-archive/moderators
/SECURITY.md                                            @stac-archive/moderators @stac-archive/infra
/SUPPORT.md                                             @stac-archive/moderators
/LICENSE*                                               @stac-archive/moderators
